# Line endings are decided here, not by each machine's core.autocrlf.
#
# Text files are stored with LF in the repository; each working copy still
# checks out its platform's native convention, so nothing changes about
# editing them on Windows. Only the stored form is pinned — which is the
# form diffs, merges and GitHub actually see.
#
# Added September 17, 2026, after two clones of this repo disagreed about
# line endings. Every blob was already LF at that point, so this pins the
# existing state rather than changing it; no renormalise was needed.
#
# Binary files (the thumbnail JPG) are auto-detected and left alone.
* text=auto
